  <user_flow>
    <primary_path><![CDATA[
**Step 1: View kanban board**
- User sees application cards organized by stage
- Column counts updated in real-time
- Visual indicators for urgent items (expiring offers, upcoming interviews)

**Step 2: Interact with cards**
- Hover over card shows action menu (view details, move, delete)
- Click card opens detail modal with:
  - Full job description
  - Timeline of communications
  - Action buttons (schedule interview, accept offer, etc.)

**Step 3: Move cards**
- Drag card between columns to update application stage
- System confirms status change
- Timeline updated in card detail

**Step 4: Take action**
- From card detail modal:
  - Schedule interview (ApplicationStatusActions)
  - Accept offer (ApplicationStatusActions)
  - Mark as rejected (ApplicationStatusActions)
  - Add notes (ApplicationEditForm)
  - Download offer letter (ApplicationStatusActions)

**Step 5: Archive**
- Move rejected or closed applications to archived column (ApplicationArchiveAction)
- Can restore later if needed
    ]]></primary_path>
  </user_flow>

  <states>
    <default><![CDATA[
- All columns visible (5 columns: Applied, Interviewing, Offered, Rejected, Archived)
- Cards organized by application stage
- Hover states active
- Detail modal closed
    ]]></default>
    <dragging><![CDATA[
- Dragged card shows opacity 0.6 with spring transform
- Target column highlights in inkGold via spring border-color transition
- Drop zones visible
    ]]></dragging>
    <modal_open><![CDATA[
- Background dims (Megaphone backdrop)
- Detail modal appears with spring opacity+transform animation
- Tabbed content: timeline | notes | details
- ApplicationEditForm visible in left pane
- ApplicationStatusActions visible in right pane
- ApplicationArchiveAction at bottom right
- Focus trapped in modal
    ]]></modal_open>
    <empty><![CDATA[
- No applications yet
- Scaffold empty state with prompt to add first application
- Strike CTA: "Add your first application"
    ]]></empty>
    <loading><![CDATA[
- Skeleton placards in each column
- Column headers visible with count = 0
    ]]></loading>
    <error><![CDATA[
- Error banner at top of board
- Retry Strike CTA
- Last-known board state preserved if available
    ]]></error>
  </states>

